    "detailed_description": "A quirky, self-aware, fourth-wall-breaking visual novel with multiple paths, many endings (some paths MUCH shorter than others, where one wrong move leads to an an untimely demise!)<br><br>Meet a time-bending witch. Befriend a mysterious, eccentric, yet disarmingly cute artist. Push the boundaries of possibilities with humour that doesn't conform to reality.<br><br>A few examples of possible adventures:<br><br>- Irritate a character so much that they explode<br>- Unlock a playable dinosaur character and eat characters instead of talking to them<br>- Inadvertently break the logic of the universe and cause an essential main character to burst into flames<br>- Set up a water park and become rich, before continuing on your adventure<br>- Hugely misinterpret a line in the game's dialogue and discuss it with the game's backstage crew to resolve it<br>- Get thrown by a tree on its (alleged) birthday<br><br>...and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828380/extras/11ce7d356bdd221103fc99aee11101ea.poster.avif?t=1638064217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828380/extras/11ce7d356bdd221103fc99aee11101ea.webm?t=1638064217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828380/extras/11ce7d356bdd221103fc99aee11101ea.mp4?t=1638064217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Can you unlock a dozen or so endings and save yourself from eternal servitude at the hands of the evil time-bending cookie witch? Let's hope so!",
    "about_the_game": "A quirky, self-aware, fourth-wall-breaking visual novel with multiple paths, many endings (some paths MUCH shorter than others, where one wrong move leads to an an untimely demise!)<br><br>Meet a time-bending witch. Befriend a mysterious, eccentric, yet disarmingly cute artist. Push the boundaries of possibilities with humour that doesn't conform to reality.<br><br>A few examples of possible adventures:<br><br>- Irritate a character so much that they explode<br>- Unlock a playable dinosaur character and eat characters instead of talking to them<br>- Inadvertently break the logic of the universe and cause an essential main character to burst into flames<br>- Set up a water park and become rich, before continuing on your adventure<br>- Hugely misinterpret a line in the game's dialogue and discuss it with the game's backstage crew to resolve it<br>- Get thrown by a tree on its (alleged) birthday<br><br>...and more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828380/extras/11ce7d356bdd221103fc99aee11101ea.poster.avif?t=1638064217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828380/extras/11ce7d356bdd221103fc99aee11101ea.webm?t=1638064217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1828380/extras/11ce7d356bdd221103fc99aee11101ea.mp4?t=1638064217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Can you unlock a dozen or so endings and save yourself from eternal servitude at the hands of the evil time-bending cookie witch? Let's hope so!",
    "short_description": "Visual novel, multiple endings, lost in a forest inhabited by an evil time witch who bakes magic cookies. Unlock the endings and defeat the witch! (Then play all over again as a dinosaur!)",
